# ━━━ Production Environment Template ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file:  cp .env.prod.example .env.prod
# Fill all values, then:  docker compose -f infra/docker-compose.prod.yml up -d
#
# WARNING: Never commit .env.prod — it contains real secrets.

# ━━━ APP ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
APP_NAME="My SaaS"
APP_URL="https://yourdomain.com"
APP_DOMAIN="yourdomain.com"
ENVIRONMENT="production"
ADMIN_EMAIL="admin@yourdomain.com"

# ━━━ DATABASE ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
POSTGRES_USER="saas_user"
POSTGRES_PASSWORD="GENERATE_A_STRONG_RANDOM_PASSWORD_HERE"
POSTGRES_DB="saas_db"
DATABASE_URL="postgresql+asyncpg://saas_user:GENERATE_A_STRONG_RANDOM_PASSWORD_HERE@postgres:5432/saas_db"

# ━━━ REDIS ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
REDIS_URL="redis://redis:6379"

# ━━━ AUTH ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Generate: openssl rand -hex 32
JWT_SECRET="CHANGE_THIS_TO_A_64_CHARACTER_RANDOM_STRING_MINIMUM"
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=15
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

# ━━━ SUPER ADMIN ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL="admin@yourdomain.com"
SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD="GENERATE_A_STRONG_ADMIN_PASSWORD"

# ━━━ OAUTH ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Set to true and fill credentials to enable social login
GOOGLE_AUTH_ENABLED=false
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=""

GITHUB_AUTH_ENABLED=false
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=""
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=""

MICROSOFT_AUTH_ENABLED=false
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=""
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_SECRET=""

# ━━━ EMAIL ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Production: use Resend, SendGrid, or SMTP (MailHog is dev-only)
EMAIL_PROVIDER="resend"   # Options: resend, sendgrid, smtp, mailhog
EMAIL_FROM="noreply@yourdomain.com"
EMAIL_FROM_NAME="My SaaS"

# Resend (recommended for production)
RESEND_API_KEY="re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"

# SendGrid alternative
SENDGRID_API_KEY=""

# SMTP fallback
SMTP_HOST=""
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_TLS=true
SMTP_USER=""
SMTP_PASSWORD=""

# MailHog (development only — do NOT use in production)
MAILHOG_HOST=mailhog
MAILHOG_PORT=1025
